.TH "PACE ACTIVITY EXPORT" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace activity export Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-activity\-export \- Download an activity in...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace activity export
[OPTIONS] ACTIVITY_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download an activity in GPX/TCX/KML/original format.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f,\fP \-\-format [gpx|tcx|kml|original]
Export format.  [default: gpx]
.TP
\fB\-o,\fP \-\-out PATH
Output file (default: <activity_id>.<ext> in cwd).
